{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mak is included as part of The Bazaar's &quot;Hero Bundle&quot; Edition.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mak pack adds the playable hero Mak to The Bazaar! Each hero\u00a0brings an entirely new experience to The Bazaar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This master alchemist has spent centuries searching for the power to undo a tragic mistake. Already possessing vast knowledge of the arcane arts, Mak seeks an even greater power buried beneath The Bazaar\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884450/extras/f979d00a6c0b70ebbf0bd75c041a3be8.poster.avif?t=1755115247\" aria-label=\"An in-game combat showcasing Mak&#039;s potions transforming as they are activated\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884450/extras/f979d00a6c0b70ebbf0bd75c041a3be8.webm?t=1755115247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884450/extras/f979d00a6c0b70ebbf0bd75c041a3be8.mp4?t=1755115247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Mak alongside over 190 items, skills, and encounters unique to Mak</strong>. Brew powerful potions, transfigure reagants into powerful items with Mak's &quot;Transform&quot; ability, and delve deeper into the arcane secrets of The Bazaar!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884450?t=1755115247","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884450/9c01133a2291e62b34357566aba83f028ec91f59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755115247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884450/12b3db2f3ee1dd8daac040c42338ea9f20555de2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17